#!/usr/bin/python3
"""omarchy-remote — media remote service for phones.

Controls this computer's media from a phone on the same Wi-Fi:

  * play / pause, next / previous, seek ±10 s
  * volume up / down / mute
  * album art

Security:
  * HTTPS (a fresh self-signed certificate + fingerprint on every start)
  * QR pairing; the token lives in the URL fragment (#), never sent over the wire
  * binds to the LAN interface only, not to every address
  * restarting the service rotates certificate and token -> pair again

Usage:
  omarchy-remote start [--port 8765] [--bind IP]
  omarchy-remote stop
  omarchy-remote status
  omarchy-remote pair        (pairing URL + terminal QR)
"""

